"Wastewater Treatment — Process Flow": "污水处理 — 工艺流程",
"Screening, grit, primary and secondary clarifiers, activated sludge with blowers, UV, sludge digestion and dewatering, with flow and DO instruments. Pro.": "格栅、沉砂、初沉池和二沉池、带鼓风机的活性污泥、紫外线、污泥消化和脱水，附流量和溶解氧仪表。Pro。",
"Pump Station P&ID": "泵站 P&ID",
"Wet well with duty/standby submersible pumps, check and isolation valves, discharge header, flow meter, level control and alarms. Pro.": "集水井配一用一备潜水泵、止回阀和隔离阀、出水总管、流量计、液位控制和报警。Pro。",
"Water Treatment Train": "给水处理流程",
"Intake, coagulant dosing and flash mixing, clarification, filtration, chlorination, clear-water storage and distribution, with quality analysers. Pro.": "取水、混凝剂投加和快速混合、澄清、过滤、加氯、清水储存和配水，附水质分析仪。Pro。",
"Seawater RO Desalination": "海水反渗透淡化",
"Intake, coagulation, media and cartridge filtration, high-pressure pump, RO membranes with an energy recovery device and booster pump, remineralisation, product storage and pumping. Pro.": "取水、混凝、介质过滤和保安过滤、高压泵、配能量回收装置和增压泵的反渗透膜、再矿化、产水储存和输送。Pro。",
"Booster Pumping Station P&ID": "增压泵站 P&ID",
"Three pumps (two duty, one standby) on variable speed drives with suction and discharge headers, check and isolation valves, surge vessel, flow and pressure control. Pro.": "三台变频泵（两用一备），带吸水和出水总管、止回阀和隔离阀、水锤罐、流量和压力控制。Pro。",
"Chemical Dosing Skid P&ID": "化学加药撬 P&ID",
"Hypochlorite storage, strainer, duty/standby dosing pumps, calibration column, pulsation damper, relief back to tank and flow-paced dosing into the main with a chlorine analyser. Pro.": "次氯酸盐储罐、过滤器、一用一备计量泵、标定柱、脉动阻尼器、回罐泄压，以及按流量向主管加药并配余氯分析仪。Pro。",
"LV Single-Line Diagram": "低压单线图",
"Utility supply, transformer and main breaker with a standby generator through an ATS, 400 V busbar and feeders to distribution boards, an MCC, motors, power-factor correction and a surge arrester. Pro.": "市电进线、变压器和总断路器，经 ATS 接备用发电机，400 V 母线及馈线至配电柜、MCC、电机，功率因数补偿和浪涌保护器。Pro。",
"Pump Station Power SLD": "泵站供电单线图",
"Transformer and main breaker feeding three VSD pump motors, a DOL drainage pump and a UPS-backed control panel; pairs with the booster station P&ID. Pro.": "变压器和总断路器为三台变频泵电机、一台直接启动排水泵和一个带 UPS 的控制柜供电；与增压泵站 P&ID 配套。Pro。",
"Motor Starters": "电机启动器",
"Direct-on-line, soft starter with bypass contactor and variable speed drive power circuits side by side, with protection devices tagged. Pro.": "直接启动、带旁路接触器的软启动器和变频器主电路并排对比，保护设备均有位号。Pro。",
"Beverage Bottling Line": "饮料灌装线",
"Filler, capper, labeller, accumulation table, checkweigher, case packer, palletizer and stretch wrapper, with cycle times per bottle and a demand card: Line Balance finds takt and the bottleneck. Pro.": "灌装机、旋盖机、贴标机、缓冲台、检重秤、装箱机、码垛机和缠绕机，带每瓶节拍时间和需求卡：产线平衡可找出节拍和瓶颈。Pro。",
"Pharma Tablet Line": "制药片剂生产线",
"Solid-dose line from dispensing, granulation, drying, blending, compression and coating to inspection, blister packing, cartoning and palletizing; the blister packer is over takt. Pro.": "固体制剂线，从配料、制粒、干燥、混合、压片和包衣，到检查、泡罩包装、装盒和码垛；泡罩包装机超出节拍。Pro。",
"Snack Packaging Line": "零食包装线",
"Fryer, cooling, seasoning, multihead weigher, two flow wrappers in parallel, metal detector, checkweigher, case packer and palletizer. Pro.": "油炸机、冷却、调味、组合秤、两台并联枕式包装机、金属检测机、检重秤、装箱机和码垛机。Pro。",
"U-Shaped Assembly Cell": "U 型装配单元",
"Six stations around a U with three operators inside, balanced against takt; connectors set the order material flows. Pro.": "六个工位围成 U 型，内侧三名操作员，按节拍平衡；连接线决定物料流动顺序。Pro。",
"Value Stream Map — Current State": "价值流图 — 现状",
"A yoghurt plant: supplier, production control and customer, four process boxes with data boxes, inventories, push arrows and the lead-time ladder. Pro.": "一家酸奶厂：供应商、生产控制和客户，四个带数据框的工序框、库存、推动箭头和交付周期阶梯。Pro。",
"IIoT Monitoring Architecture": "IIoT 监控架构",
"Sensors and a PLC on the plant floor, an edge gateway publishing to an MQTT broker, Node-RED flows, a time-series database, dashboards, cloud and mobile alerts; data moves along the lines. Pro.": "车间的传感器和 PLC、向 MQTT 代理发布的边缘网关、Node-RED 流程、时序数据库、仪表板、云端和手机告警；数据沿连线流动。Pro。",
"Purdue Model (ISA-95 / IEC 62443)": "普渡模型 (ISA-95 / IEC 62443)",
"The levels of an industrial network from field devices and PLCs through supervisory, operations and the DMZ to the business network and cloud, with firewalls between zones. Pro.": "工业网络的各层级，从现场设备和 PLC，经监控、运营和 DMZ，到企业网络和云端，各区域之间设有防火墙。Pro。",
"Pump Station Telemetry": "泵站遥测",
"Level, flow, pressure and energy measurements into an RTU, a cellular link to a cloud SCADA, and alarms on phones; pairs with the pump station P&ID. Pro.": "液位、流量、压力和电能测量接入 RTU，蜂窝链路连至云端 SCADA，并向手机报警；与泵站 P&ID 配套。Pro。",
"LoRaWAN Cold-Chain Monitoring": "LoRaWAN 冷链监控",
